                                <h1 id=3D"linux-installation-and-setup">Lin=
ux Installation and Setup</h1>
<h2 id=3D"prerequisites">Prerequisites<a class=3D"anchorjs-link " href=3D"h=
ttps://docs.cocos2d-x.org/cocos2d-x/v4/en/installation/Linux.html#prerequis=
ites" aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" style=3D"font:=
 1em / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h2>
<p>A supported environment. See <strong><a href=3D"https://docs.cocos2d-x.o=
rg/cocos2d-x/v4/en/installation/prerequisites.html">Installation Prerequisi=
tes</a></strong></p>
<h2 id=3D"ubuntu-versions">Ubuntu versions<a class=3D"anchorjs-link " href=
=3D"https://docs.cocos2d-x.org/cocos2d-x/v4/en/installation/Linux.html#ubun=
tu-versions" aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" style=
=3D"font: 1em / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h2>
<p>We support Ubuntu 12.10+, however, newer versions of Ubuntu have changed=
 and the steps to install <strong>Cocos2d-x</strong> and required dependenc=
ies are a bit different. This requires some manual effort and this doc will=
 outline what is required.</p>
<h2 id=3D"dependencies-that-you-need">Dependencies that you need<a class=3D=
"anchorjs-link " href=3D"https://docs.cocos2d-x.org/cocos2d-x/v4/en/install=
ation/Linux.html#dependencies-that-you-need" aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anc=
horjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" style=3D"font: 1em / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-lef=
t: 0.375em;"></a></h2>
<p><strong>Cocos2d-x</strong> requires a number of dependencies be installe=
d on your system. Please perform the following steps:</p>
<h4 id=3D"update-operating-system-components">Update operating system compo=
nents<a class=3D"anchorjs-link " href=3D"https://docs.cocos2d-x.org/cocos2d=
-x/v4/en/installation/Linux.html#update-operating-system-components" aria-l=
abel=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" style=3D"font: 1em / 1 anc=
horjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h4>
<pre><code class=3D"lang-sh">  sudo apt-get update
  sudo apt-get upgrade
</code></pre>
<h4 id=3D"install-dependencies-ubuntu-16x-only">Install Dependencies <stron=
g>(Ubuntu 16.x only)</strong><a class=3D"anchorjs-link " href=3D"https://do=
cs.cocos2d-x.org/cocos2d-x/v4/en/installation/Linux.html#install-dependenci=
es-ubuntu-16x-only" aria-label=3D"Anchor" data-anchorjs-icon=3D"=EE=A7=8B" =
style=3D"font: 1em / 1 anchorjs-icons; padding-left: 0.375em;"></a></h4>
<ol>
<li>Install dependencies<pre><code class=3D"lang-sh">// Ubuntu 16.x
sudo apt-get install python2 git curl g++ libgdk-pixbuf2.0-dev python-pip c=
make libx11-dev libxmu-dev libglu1-mesa-dev libgl2ps-dev libxi-dev libzip-d=
ev libpng-dev libcurl4-gnutls-dev libfontconfig1-dev libsqlite3-dev libglew=
-dev libssl-dev libgtk-3-dev libglfw3 libglfw3-dev xorg-dev
</code></pre>
</li>
</ol>
<h4 id=3D"install-dependencies-ubuntu-17x-only">Install Dependencies <stron=
